The below is attributable to Principal Deputy Spokesperson Tommy Pigott: Deputy Secretary of State Christopher Landau met today with Chairman of the Presidency of Bosnia and Herzegovina Denis Bećirović, who traveled to Washington, D.C. with his wife, Mirela Bećirović, who attended First Lady Melania Trump’s Fostering the Future Together event. The leaders focused on economic cooperation, including the Southern Interconnection gas pipeline as a key step driver of the bilateral relationship.